The Shutter Tester Expansion Board Frame is required when using the optional pcb, rather than the standard screw-terminal breakout board.

It can also be used to mount the standard screw-terminal board as an option.

As the pcb is smaller than the tft screen, this frame alingns with the tft mounting holes.

The pcb is then mounted to the frame, using self tapping screws through the pre-drilled holes in the pcb.

Note you will have to drill pilot holes into the frame.

